(42, 14, '2025-02-13', 'Punch In', 'Hi Nithin, I have only taken half-day leave on 13-Feb for my father eye checkup and 2nd half I\'ve worked but in HRMS it is showing full day leave.\r\nI\'m requesting you to give me half-day attendance on 13-02-2025.', NULL, 'Pending', '2025-02-21 12:45:35', '2025-02-21 12:45:35');
