(14, 'APISOD CO', 'API-SC-01', 'Supply Chain Trainee', '[\"Operations\"]', '3', 'Hyderabad', 'Full Time', '14', '2025-01-06', '2025-01-24', '{\"email\":\"admin@apisod.ai\",\"phone\":null}', 'Bachelors', 'Active', '[\"Insurance\",\"Bonus\"]', '50,000/-', 'Work from Home', 'Morning', '25%', '<p>Operations</p>', '<p>via admin@apisod.ai</p>', NULL, NULL),
(15, 'APISOD CO', 'API-EM-01', 'Engineer Sr', '[\"CAD\",\"Python\"]', '6', 'Hyderabad', 'Full Time', '17', '2025-01-06', '2025-01-23', '{\"email\":\"admin@apisod.ai\",\"phone\":null}', 'Bachelors', 'Active', '[\"WFH\",\"Insurance\"]', '80,000/-', 'Work from Home', 'Morning', '25%', '<p>Engineering works</p>', '<p>via email admin@apisod.ai</p>', NULL, NULL),
(16, 'APISOD CO', 'APS-SD-67', 'Software Developer', '[\"JS\",\"SQL\"]', '3', 'Hyderabad', 'Full Time', '7', '2025-01-15', '2025-01-17', '{\"email\":\"admin@apisod.ai\",\"phone\":null}', 'B.Tech/M.Tech/BBA', 'Active', '[\"WFH\",\"Insurance\"]', '8,00,000/- to 10,00,000/-', 'Work from Home', 'Morning', 'No', '<p>We are looking for a Software Developer to build and implement functional programs. You will work with other Developers and Product Managers throughout the software development life cycle. In this role, you should be a team player with a keen eye for detail and problem-solving skills. If you also have experience in Agile frameworks and popular coding languages (e.g. JavaScript), we’d like to meet you. Your goal will be to build efficient programs and systems that serve user needs.</p><p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p><ul><li>Work with developers to design algorithms and flowcharts</li><li>Produce clean, efficient code based on specifications</li><li>Integrate software components and third-party programs</li><li>Verify and deploy programs and systems</li><li>Troubleshoot, debug and upgrade existing software</li><li>Gather and evaluate user feedback</li><li>Recommend and execute improvements</li><li>Create technical documentation for reference and reporting</li></ul>', '<p>via @admin@apisod.ai</p>', NULL, NULL),
(17, 'APISOD Tech Pvt Ltd', 'API31012025001', 'Software Developer', '[\".Net\",\"PHP\",\"MS\"]', '5.3', 'Noida', 'Full Time', '7', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-17', '{\"email\":\"lprasad@apisod.ai\",\"phone\":null}', 'B.tech', 'Active', '[\"All Benefit with bonus\"]', '12,00,000 -15,00,000', 'Work from Home', 'Regular', 'No', '<p>We are seeking an experienced Data Management Executive to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate will possess strong expertise in managing large data sets, ensuring data integrity, and generating insights for business decisions. If you have excellent analytical skills, a keen attention to detail, and experience in database management, we would love to have you on board.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p><p><strong>1. Data Management:</strong></p><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Manage large sets of data and ensure accuracy and integrity across multiple sources.</li></ul><p><strong>2. Data Quality &amp; Consistency:</strong></p><ul><li>Develop and maintain data management processes to ensure data consistency and high quality across systems.</li></ul><p><strong>3</strong>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Data Analysis &amp; Reporting:</strong></p><ul><li>Analyze data and provide actionable insights to inform business decisions and strategies.</li></ul><p><strong>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Collaboration:</strong></p><ul><li>Work closely with cross-functional teams to identify key data needs and requirements.</li><li>Work closely with cross-functional teams to identify key data needs and requirements.</li></ul><p><strong>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Reporting &amp; Visualization:</strong></p><ul><li>Create detailed reports, data visualizations, and dashboards to effectively communicate insights to stakeholders.</li></ul><p><strong>6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Database Development &amp; Maintenance:</strong></p><ul><li>Develop and maintain database systems to enable efficient data storage and retrieval.</li></ul><p><strong>7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Trend Identification:</strong></p><ul><li>Apply statistical and data mining techniques to identify trends and patterns in complex data sets.</li></ul>', '<p><strong>To apply for the Data Management Executive position, please follow these steps:</strong></p><p><strong>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Prepare Your Resume:</strong></p><ul><li>Update your resume with relevant experience, highlighting skills in database management, data analysis, and Excel proficiency.</li></ul><p><strong>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cover Letter (Optional):</strong></p><ul><li>Write a brief cover letter explaining why you\'re a good fit for the role and how your skills align with the responsibilities outlined in the JD.</li></ul><p><strong>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Submit Your Application:</strong></p><ul><li>your resume (and cover letter, if applicable) to [Email Address] or apply directly through [Application Portal].</li><li>your resume (and cover letter, if applicable) to [Email Address] or apply directly through [Application Portal].</li></ul><p><strong>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Interview Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If shortlisted, you will be contacted for an interview. Please be prepared to discuss your previous experience.</li><li>your approach to data management, and your skills in database systems and analysis.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL),
(18, 'APISOD CO', 'API05022025001', 'JAVA DEVELOPER', '[\"JAVA\",\"SPRING\"]', '10+ Years', 'Hyderabad', 'Full Time', 'Product and Project Management', '2025-02-05', '2025-02-27', '{\"email\":\"admin@apisod.ai\",\"phone\":null}', 'B.Tech', 'Active', '[\"WFH\",\"Insurance\"]', '8,00,000/- - 10,00,000/-', 'Work from Home', 'Morning', 'No', '<p>Normal Description</p>', '<p>via admin@apisod.ai</p>', NULL, NULL);
